  <jpcrp_cor:ClassesOfSharesEtcTextBlock contextRef="FilingDateInstant">
&lt;p style="margin-left: 18px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;【株式の種類等】　会社法第155条第７号に該当する普通株式の取得&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 18px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
</jpcrp_cor:ClassesOfSharesEtcTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:AcquisitionsByResolutionOfShareholdersMeetingTextBlock contextRef="FilingDateInstant">
&lt;h4&gt;（1）【株主総会決議による取得の状況】&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 42px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: 12px"&gt;該当事項はありません。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 30px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: 12px"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
</jpcrp_cor:AcquisitionsByResolutionOfShareholdersMeetingTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:AcquisitionsByResolutionOfBoardOfDirectorsMeetingTextBlock contextRef="FilingDateInstant">
&lt;h4&gt;（2）【取締役会決議による取得の状況】&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 42px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: 12px"&gt;該当事項はありません。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 30px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: 12px"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
</jpcrp_cor:AcquisitionsByResolutionOfBoardOfDirectorsMeetingTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:AcquisitionsNotBasedOnResolutionOfShareholdersMeetingOrBoardOfDirectorsMeetingTextBlock contextRef="FilingDateInstant">
&lt;h4&gt;（3）【株主総会決議又は取締役会決議に基づかないものの内容】&lt;/h4&gt;
